{"format": 1, "id": "iQnXYyzQ_FN2lgAUc7zENw", "title": "CSRF and SameSite cookies", "description": "How cross-site request forgery abuses ambient cookies, and how SameSite stops it.", "frame": "landscape", "theme": "night", "tokens": {}, "status": "finished", "questions": ["Why do CSRF tokens still matter if SameSite is the default?", "What breaks when a site needs SameSite=None, like embedded widgets or SSO?", "How does SameSite differ from CORS?"], "notes": {}, "slides": [{"id": "csrf-and-samesite-cookies", "rev": 1, "kind": "title", "title": "CSRF and SameSite cookies", "classes": [], "shown": "Why a forged request carries your login, and how browsers stop it", "visual": {}, "says": [{"id": "csrf-and-samesite-cookies.1.1", "status": "ready", "text": "A malicious page can make your browser send a request to your bank. We'll see why that works, and how the SameSite attribute closes the hole.", "cues": [], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/46fb3a30a09c2133d5f2ba2b.mp3", "duration": 8.55, "words": [{"s": 0.275, "e": 0.35, "c0": 0, "c1": 1}, {"s": 0.35, "e": 0.912, "c0": 2, "c1": 11}, {"s": 0.912, "e": 1.375, "c0": 12, "c1": 16}, {"s": 1.375, "e": 1.525, "c0": 17, "c1": 20}, {"s": 1.525, "e": 1.712, "c0": 21, "c1": 25}, {"s": 1.712, "e": 1.825, "c0": 26, "c1": 30}, {"s": 1.825, "e": 2.275, "c0": 31, "c1": 38}, {"s": 2.275, "e": 2.487, "c0": 39, "c1": 43}, {"s": 2.487, "e": 2.55, "c0": 44, "c1": 45}, {"s": 2.55, "e": 3.0, "c0": 46, "c1": 53}, {"s": 3.0, "e": 3.087, "c0": 54, "c1": 56}, {"s": 3.087, "e": 3.2, "c0": 57, "c1": 61}, {"s": 3.2, "e": 3.9, "c0": 62, "c1": 66}, {"s": 4.025, "e": 4.213, "c0": 68, "c1": 73}, {"s": 4.213, "e": 4.425, "c0": 74, "c1": 77}, {"s": 4.425, "e": 4.6, "c0": 78, "c1": 81}, {"s": 4.6, "e": 4.825, "c0": 82, "c1": 86}, {"s": 4.825, "e": 5.45, "c0": 87, "c1": 92}, {"s": 5.55, "e": 5.675, "c0": 94, "c1": 97}, {"s": 5.675, "e": 5.838, "c0": 98, "c1": 101}, {"s": 5.838, "e": 5.963, "c0": 102, "c1": 105}, {"s": 5.963, "e": 6.562, "c0": 106, "c1": 114}, {"s": 6.562, "e": 7.125, "c0": 115, "c1": 124}, {"s": 7.125, "e": 7.575, "c0": 125, "c1": 131}, {"s": 7.575, "e": 7.675, "c0": 132, "c1": 135}, {"s": 7.675, "e": 8.3, "c0": 136, "c1": 140}]}]}, {"id": "ambient", "rev": 1, "kind": "diagram", "title": "Cookies ride along", "classes": [], "shown": "The browser attaches them to every request to that site, whoever started it", "visual": {"source": "sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as Browser\n    participant E as evil.com\n    participant B as bank.com\n    U->>B: log in\n    B-->>U: Set-Cookie session\n    U->>E: visit page\n    E-->>U: hidden form to bank.com\n    U->>B: POST transfer + session cookie", "type": "sequencediagram", "nodes": {"U": "Browser", "E": "evil.com", "B": "bank.com"}, "labels": ["log in", "Set-Cookie session", "visit page", "hidden form to bank.com", "POST transfer + session cookie"], "order": ["U", "E", "B"]}, "says": [{"id": "ambient.1.1", "status": "ready", "text": "You log in to the bank. It sets a session cookie, and from then on the browser sends that cookie with every request to the bank.", "cues": [{"at": 27, "end": 48, "label": "sets a session cookie", "target": "B-->>U", "text": "Set-Cookie session", "kind": "text", "t": 2.025}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/5295d09cfa7f3edc8df12459.mp3", "duration": 7.825, "words": [{"s": 0.275, "e": 0.4, "c0": 0, "c1": 3}, {"s": 0.4, "e": 0.713, "c0": 4, "c1": 7}, {"s": 0.713, "e": 0.875, "c0": 8, "c1": 10}, {"s": 0.875, "e": 0.963, "c0": 11, "c1": 13}, {"s": 0.963, "e": 1.05, "c0": 14, "c1": 17}, {"s": 1.05, "e": 1.725, "c0": 18, "c1": 22}, {"s": 1.825, "e": 2.025, "c0": 24, "c1": 26}, {"s": 2.025, "e": 2.263, "c0": 27, "c1": 31}, {"s": 2.263, "e": 2.362, "c0": 32, "c1": 33}, {"s": 2.362, "e": 2.775, "c0": 34, "c1": 41}, {"s": 2.775, "e": 3.425, "c0": 42, "c1": 48}, {"s": 3.562, "e": 3.7, "c0": 50, "c1": 53}, {"s": 3.7, "e": 3.875, "c0": 54, "c1": 58}, {"s": 3.875, "e": 4.2, "c0": 59, "c1": 63}, {"s": 4.2, "e": 4.338, "c0": 64, "c1": 66}, {"s": 4.338, "e": 4.425, "c0": 67, "c1": 70}, {"s": 4.425, "e": 4.912, "c0": 71, "c1": 78}, {"s": 4.912, "e": 5.2, "c0": 79, "c1": 84}, {"s": 5.2, "e": 5.4, "c0": 85, "c1": 89}, {"s": 5.4, "e": 5.825, "c0": 90, "c1": 96}, {"s": 5.825, "e": 6.025, "c0": 97, "c1": 101}, {"s": 6.025, "e": 6.375, "c0": 102, "c1": 107}, {"s": 6.375, "e": 6.8, "c0": 108, "c1": 115}, {"s": 6.8, "e": 6.888, "c0": 116, "c1": 118}, {"s": 6.888, "e": 6.975, "c0": 119, "c1": 122}, {"s": 6.975, "e": 7.575, "c0": 123, "c1": 127}]}, {"id": "ambient.2.1", "status": "ready", "text": "Then you open another site. That page contains a hidden form aimed at the bank.", "cues": [{"at": 9, "end": 26, "label": "open another site", "target": "U->>E", "text": "visit page", "kind": "text", "t": 0.575}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/5f0a941b205d1f384d827d67.mp3", "duration": 5.2, "words": [{"s": 0.275, "e": 0.425, "c0": 0, "c1": 4}, {"s": 0.425, "e": 0.575, "c0": 5, "c1": 8}, {"s": 0.575, "e": 0.9, "c0": 9, "c1": 13}, {"s": 0.9, "e": 1.288, "c0": 14, "c1": 21}, {"s": 1.288, "e": 1.95, "c0": 22, "c1": 26}, {"s": 2.087, "e": 2.325, "c0": 28, "c1": 32}, {"s": 2.325, "e": 2.75, "c0": 33, "c1": 37}, {"s": 2.75, "e": 3.188, "c0": 38, "c1": 46}, {"s": 3.188, "e": 3.25, "c0": 47, "c1": 48}, {"s": 3.25, "e": 3.562, "c0": 49, "c1": 55}, {"s": 3.562, "e": 3.962, "c0": 56, "c1": 60}, {"s": 3.962, "e": 4.213, "c0": 61, "c1": 66}, {"s": 4.213, "e": 4.287, "c0": 67, "c1": 69}, {"s": 4.287, "e": 4.375, "c0": 70, "c1": 73}, {"s": 4.375, "e": 4.95, "c0": 74, "c1": 78}]}, {"id": "ambient.3.1", "status": "ready", "text": "The browser submits it, and attaches your cookie, because the request is going to the bank. The bank sees a valid session and moves the money.", "cues": [{"at": 12, "end": 22, "label": "submits it", "target": "U->>B", "text": "log in", "kind": "text", "t": 0.775}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/b8e97579b2d3e926a85a2913.mp3", "duration": 8.75, "words": [{"s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "c0": 0, "c1": 3}, {"s": 0.325, "e": 0.775, "c0": 4, "c1": 11}, {"s": 0.775, "e": 1.212, "c0": 12, "c1": 19}, {"s": 1.212, "e": 1.5, "c0": 20, "c1": 22}, {"s": 1.575, "e": 1.688, "c0": 24, "c1": 27}, {"s": 1.688, "e": 2.163, "c0": 28, "c1": 36}, {"s": 2.163, "e": 2.3, "c0": 37, "c1": 41}, {"s": 2.3, "e": 2.9, "c0": 42, "c1": 48}, {"s": 3.025, "e": 3.35, "c0": 50, "c1": 57}, {"s": 3.35, "e": 3.45, "c0": 58, "c1": 61}, {"s": 3.45, "e": 4.0, "c0": 62, "c1": 69}, {"s": 4.0, "e": 4.15, "c0": 70, "c1": 72}, {"s": 4.15, "e": 4.5, "c0": 73, "c1": 78}, {"s": 4.5, "e": 4.588, "c0": 79, "c1": 81}, {"s": 4.588, "e": 4.675, "c0": 82, "c1": 85}, {"s": 4.675, "e": 5.425, "c0": 86, "c1": 90}, {"s": 5.588, "e": 5.7, "c0": 92, "c1": 95}, {"s": 5.7, "e": 6.025, "c0": 96, "c1": 100}, {"s": 6.025, "e": 6.237, "c0": 101, "c1": 105}, {"s": 6.237, "e": 6.338, "c0": 106, "c1": 107}, {"s": 6.338, "e": 6.737, "c0": 108, "c1": 113}, {"s": 6.737, "e": 7.287, "c0": 114, "c1": 121}, {"s": 7.287, "e": 7.45, "c0": 122, "c1": 125}, {"s": 7.45, "e": 7.775, "c0": 126, "c1": 131}, {"s": 7.775, "e": 7.875, "c0": 132, "c1": 135}, {"s": 7.875, "e": 8.5, "c0": 136, "c1": 141}]}]}, {"id": "recipe", "rev": 2, "kind": "list", "title": "What the attacker needs", "classes": ["cards"], "shown": "", "visual": {"style": "cards", "items": [{"id": "a", "title": "Session cookie", "body": "sent automatically", "icon": "cookie"}, {"id": "b", "title": "Known request", "body": "no secret to guess", "icon": "target"}, {"id": "c", "title": "A visit", "body": "to the attacker's page", "icon": "link"}]}, "says": [{"id": "recipe.1.2", "status": "ready", "text": "The first condition is a cookie based session. The victim's browser supplies the credentials, not the attacker.", "cues": [{"at": 23, "end": 45, "label": "a cookie based session", "target": "a", "text": "", "kind": "item", "id": "a", "t": 1.387}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/29982cbcafd0e7f224fdafcf.mp3", "duration": 6.975, "words": [{"s": 0.25, "e": 0.362, "c0": 0, "c1": 3}, {"s": 0.362, "e": 0.675, "c0": 4, "c1": 9}, {"s": 0.675, "e": 1.262, "c0": 10, "c1": 19}, {"s": 1.262, "e": 1.387, "c0": 20, "c1": 22}, {"s": 1.387, "e": 1.488, "c0": 23, "c1": 24}, {"s": 1.488, "e": 1.825, "c0": 25, "c1": 31}, {"s": 1.825, "e": 2.15, "c0": 32, "c1": 37}, {"s": 2.15, "e": 2.95, "c0": 38, "c1": 45}, {"s": 3.075, "e": 3.175, "c0": 47, "c1": 50}, {"s": 3.175, "e": 3.6, "c0": 51, "c1": 59}, {"s": 3.6, "e": 4.138, "c0": 60, "c1": 67}, {"s": 4.138, "e": 4.638, "c0": 68, "c1": 76}, {"s": 4.638, "e": 4.725, "c0": 77, "c1": 80}, {"s": 4.725, "e": 5.475, "c0": 81, "c1": 92}, {"s": 5.575, "e": 5.787, "c0": 94, "c1": 97}, {"s": 5.787, "e": 5.925, "c0": 98, "c1": 101}, {"s": 5.925, "e": 6.725, "c0": 102, "c1": 110}]}, {"id": "recipe.2.2", "status": "ready", "text": "Second, a request whose every parameter the attacker can predict. The bank can't tell it from a real one.", "cues": [{"at": 8, "end": 17, "label": "a request", "target": "b", "text": "", "kind": "item", "id": "b", "t": 0.875}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/6e05ed2a2c69afa31379ee2e.mp3", "duration": 6.825, "words": [{"s": 0.3, "e": 0.8, "c0": 0, "c1": 6}, {"s": 0.875, "e": 0.975, "c0": 8, "c1": 9}, {"s": 0.975, "e": 1.65, "c0": 10, "c1": 17}, {"s": 1.65, "e": 1.887, "c0": 18, "c1": 23}, {"s": 1.887, "e": 2.225, "c0": 24, "c1": 29}, {"s": 2.225, "e": 2.788, "c0": 30, "c1": 39}, {"s": 2.788, "e": 2.925, "c0": 40, "c1": 43}, {"s": 2.925, "e": 3.4, "c0": 44, "c1": 52}, {"s": 3.4, "e": 3.525, "c0": 53, "c1": 56}, {"s": 3.525, "e": 4.4, "c0": 57, "c1": 64}, {"s": 4.525, "e": 4.625, "c0": 66, "c1": 69}, {"s": 4.625, "e": 4.963, "c0": 70, "c1": 74}, {"s": 4.963, "e": 5.263, "c0": 75, "c1": 80}, {"s": 5.263, "e": 5.487, "c0": 81, "c1": 85}, {"s": 5.487, "e": 5.6, "c0": 86, "c1": 88}, {"s": 5.6, "e": 5.737, "c0": 89, "c1": 93}, {"s": 5.737, "e": 5.8, "c0": 94, "c1": 95}, {"s": 5.8, "e": 6.05, "c0": 96, "c1": 100}, {"s": 6.05, "e": 6.575, "c0": 101, "c1": 104}]}, {"id": "recipe.3.2", "status": "ready", "text": "Third, one visit. The attacker never reads the response. A side effect is enough.", "cues": [{"at": 7, "end": 16, "label": "one visit", "target": "c", "text": "", "kind": "item", "id": "c", "t": 0.675}], "notes": [], "code": [], "audio": "audio/7b73406d754453a8c2cc89c2.mp3", "duration": 5.625, "words": [{"s": 0.3, "e": 0.625, "c0": 0, "c1": 5}, {"s": 0.675, "e": 0.925, "c0": 7, "c1": 10}, {"s": 0.925, "e": 1.5, "c0": 11, "c1": 16}, {"s": 1.6, "e": 1.725, "c0": 18, "c1": 21}, {"s": 1.725, "e": 2.212, "c0": 22, "c1": 30}, {"s": 2.212, "e": 2.55, "c0": 31, "c1": 36}, {"s": 2.55, "e": 2.888, "c0": 37, "c1": 42}, {"s": 2.888, "e": 2.975, "c0": 43, "c1": 46}, {"s": 2.975, "e": 3.75, "c0": 47, "c1": 55}, {"s": 3.862, "e": 4.0, "c0": 57, "c1": 58}, {"s": 4.0, "e": 4.287, "c0": 59, "c1": 63}, {"s": 4.287, "e": 4.612, "c0": 64, "c1": 70}, {"s": 4.612, "e": 4.725, "c0": 71, "c1": 73}, {"s": 4.725, "e": 5.375, "c0": 74, "c1": 80}]}], "icons": {"cookie": "<path d=\"M11 17h.01\"/><path d=\"M11.496 2c.324-.016.558.292.529.615a4 4 0 004.235 4.368.713.713 0 01.758.757 4 4 0 004.366 4.237c.323-.03.63.204.614.527a10 10 0 01-2.915 6.566A1 1 0 114.93 4.918 10 10 0 0111.496 2\"/><path d=\"M12 12h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 16h.01\"/><path d=\"M16 3h.01\"/><path d=\"M21 4h.01\"/><path d=\"M21 8h.01\"/><path d=\"M7 14h.01\"/><path d=\"M9 8h.01\"/>", "target": "<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/>", "link": "<path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"/><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"/>"}}, {"id": "form", "rev": 1, "kind": "code", "title": "The forged form", "classes": [], "shown": "One auto-submitting form is the whole attack", "visual": {"lang": "html", "code": "<!-- on evil.com -->\n<form action=\"https://bank.com/transfer\" method=\"POST\">\n  <input name=\"to\" value=\"attacker\">\n  <input name=\"amount\" value=\"5